Z||000000||mrfiero||01-09-2001||07:40 PM||||OK.....when I turn the key to "on" the pump hums and I hear the relay click.  So far so good.......the problem is the pump keeps humming.  Isn't it supposed to shut off after the system pressurizes?<P><BR>I don't have any of my other Fieros at home to see what they do.  I'm asking this because it is hard to start and idles strange.<P>LMK if the pump is supposed to stop humming after it pressurizes.<P>Thanks.   ||||reg||5
